<article><h3>Badges: variants, pill, square, dot and positioned</h3><div class="studio-row"><span v-for="v in ['success','warning','danger','info']" :key="v" :class="['sk-badge',v]">{{v}}</span><span class="sk-badge sk-pill">Pill</span><span class="sk-badge sk-sharp">Square</span><span class="sk-status-dot" aria-label="Online"></span>Online</div><div class="studio-row"><button @click="toast('Inbox')">Inbox <span class="sk-badge info">4</span></button><button class="sk-positioned" @click="toast('Notifications')">Notifications<span class="sk-counter">9</span></button></div></article>
<article><h3>Alerts: variants, actions, icon and dismissible</h3><div class="sk-alert info"><strong>ⓘ Report ready</strong><p>Your fictitious report is available.</p><button @click="toast('Report opened')">View sample</button></div><div v-if="alertOpen" class="sk-alert warning"><strong>⚠ Review needed</strong><button aria-label="Dismiss sample alert" @click="alertOpen=false">×</button></div><button v-else @click="alertOpen=true">Restore alert</button><div class="sk-alert success">✓ Complete</div><div class="sk-alert danger">! Local error sample</div></article>
<article><h3>Cards: header, footer, image and horizontal</h3><div class="sk-card"><header><strong>Monthly report</strong></header><div class="sk-card-image" role="img" aria-label="Abstract accent illustration">↗</div><p>Card body with a generated CSS illustration.</p><footer><span>Updated today</span><button @click="toast('Card selected')">Open</button></footer></div><div class="sk-horizontal-card"><div class="sk-card-image" role="img" aria-label="Small abstract illustration">◈</div><div><strong>Team report</strong><small>Horizontal layout</small></div></div></article>
<article><h3>Cards: highlighted, list and grid groups</h3><div class="sk-card sk-highlight"><strong>Highlighted card</strong><p>Use emphasis for a decision, not every surface.</p></div><div class="sk-mini-grid"><div class="sk-card" v-for="n in 2" :key="n">Grid {{n}}</div></div><div class="sk-card" v-for="n in 2" :key="n">List group {{n}}</div></article>
