<article><h3>List groups: active, disabled and actions</h3><div class="sk-vertical"><button class="active" @click="toast('Active list item')">Active item <span class="sk-badge">3</span></button><button @click="toast('List action')">Action item</button><button disabled>Disabled item</button><button @click="toast('List detail')"><strong>Detailed item</strong><small>Supporting description</small></button></div></article>
<article class="sk-wide"><h3>Tables: basic, striped, hover, border, compact and states</h3><input type="search" v-model="search" aria-label="Extended table search" placeholder="Filter companies"/><div class="sk-table-wrap"><table class="sk-variant-table"><thead><tr><th><button @click="sort=!sort">Company {{sort?'↓':'↑'}}</button></th><th>Status</th><th>Amount</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="r in rows" :key="r.name"><td>{{r.name}}</td><td><span :class="['sk-badge',r.status.toLowerCase()]">{{r.status}}</span></td><td>${{r.amount.toLocaleString('en-US')}}</td></tr><tr v-if="!rows.length"><td colspan="3">No matching rows <button @click="search=''">Reset filter</button></td></tr></tbody></table></div><small>Striped, hover, bordered, compact and dark-header variants combined here. Status remains textual.</small></article>
